{
  "abstract": "This is a Lean 4 formalization of Theorem 1.1 from the paper \"Power weight inequalities for spherical maximal functions\" by M. Fraccaroli, J. Roos, and A. Seeger, 2602.17613.\nSpherical maximal functions with arbitrary sets of positive dilation radii are studied on Lebesgue spaces with radial power weights. The allowable exponent and weight ranges are characterized, apart from endpoint boundedness, by the Legendre-Assouad function of the dilation set. An open problem of Duoandikoetxea and Seijo is thereby resolved up to endpoints.",
